# The rekordbox test kit's Windows PowerShell 5.1 gate (tests/rekordbox/win/ps51-check.ps1) on the
# VM's own powershell.exe 5.1 and .NET Framework. tests/rekordbox/win/ps51-gate.sh copies the kit to
# the share's ps51/ first and runs this suite:
#   tests/rekordbox/win/ps51-gate.sh ["clean Windows (shut down)"]
# MODE  SECS NAME  SCRIPT
need file ps51/ps51-check.ps1
sys     600  ps51  ps51/check.ps1
